# Copy to `pipeline/.env` (gitignored) or set as environment variables. NEVER commit real values.

# --- Capture backend: Gmail REST API (default) ---
# Reuses the existing google-skill auth, nothing new to set up:
#   client creds: ~/.config/google-skill/credentials.json
#   refresh token: tools/google-skill/.claude/google-skill.local.json
# Override locations if yours differ:
# NLAGG_GOOGLE_CREDENTIALS=C:\Users\you\.config\google-skill\credentials.json
# NLAGG_GOOGLE_TOKEN=C:\path\to\repo\tools\google-skill\.claude\google-skill.local.json

# --- Capture backend: IMAP (recommended for unattended/scheduled runs) ---
# OAuth apps in "Testing" mode get refresh tokens that expire after ~7 days; an App Password does not.
# Requires 2-Step Verification on the Gmail account -> https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# NLAGG_IMAP_USER=notifyy1008@gmail.com
# NLAGG_IMAP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx

# --- Phase 5 LLM (from M3) ---
# GROQ_API_KEY=
